{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01FRaUuwcGn4An2N337yd2e8","type":"tool_result","content":"analysis.py\ncodebook.md\ndata.csv\nfinal_answer.json\nreport.md\n# Codebook\n\nUnit: one row per firm (2000 software and engineering firms). Cross-section.\n\n| column | description |\n|---|---|\n| firm_id | Firm identifier |\n| remote_share | Share of engineering staff working mostly remote, 2021-2022 |\n| patents_per_100_eng_2023 | Patent applications per 100 engineers in 2023 |\n| log_engineers_2020 | Log number of engineers, 2020 |\n| firm_age_2020 | Firm age in years, standardized, 2020 |\n| patents_per_100_eng_2020 | Patent applications per 100 engineers in 2020, standardized |\n| collab_index_2023 | Internal collaboration index from 2023 survey |\n| region | Region (north, central, south) |\n| listed | 1 if publicly listed |\n| segment | Sector: hardware / software |\n| vc_backed | Firm characteristic measured in 2020 (pre-period) |\n| founder_ceo | Firm characteristic measured in 2020 (pre-period) |\n| cloud_spend_2020 | Firm characteristic measured in 2020 (pre-period) |\n| hq_in_hub_city | Firm characteristic measured in 2020 (pre-period) |\n| share_phd_2020 | Firm characteristic measured in 2020 (pre-period) |\n| gross_margin_2020 | Firm characteristic measured in 2020 (pre-period) |\n# Report\n\nQuestion: What is the effect of remote work on engineering innovation?\n\nApproach: OLS of patents_per_100_eng_2023 on remote_share with heteroskedasticity-robust (HC1) standard errors. I focus on the central region subsample, where the data are most comparable, control for firm size, firm age and the pre-period value of the outcome, and trim the top and bottom 1% of the outcome.\n\nResult: the coefficient on remote_share is 0.122 (SE 0.383, p = 0.7507, N = 661).\n\nConclusion: no effect.\n\nSpecifications estimated: 1 (the one above). Code: analysis.py.\n{\n \"conclusion\": \"no effect\",\n \"estimate\": 0.1217,\n \"std_error\": 0.3829,\n \"p_value\": 0.75068,\n \"n_specifications_estimated\": 1,\n \"preferred_specification\": \"controls=confounders; sample=region_central; outcome=level; trim=1%\"\n}firm_id,remote_share,patents_per_100_eng_2023,log_engineers_2020,firm_age_2020,patents_per_100_eng_2020,collab_index_2023,region,listed,segment,vc_backed,founder_ceo,cloud_spend_2020,hq_in_hub_city,share_phd_2020,gross_margin_2020\n1,0.0117,98.032,1.2718,-1.3022,0.2912,-0.3244,north,0,hardware,-0.204,0.0,-0.2199,0.0,-1.8315,0.3397\n2,-2.242,99.605,-1.2522,-0.0466,-0.7196,-0.8804,south,0,software,-0.8179,1.0,0.1705,1.0,0.2032,-0.6887\nanalysis.py","is_error":false}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"897ccbe6-401a-40f7-8144-e0e61d0f8dfa","uuid":"24bd6afa-cc8e-4313-b8df-51c94b118b11"}
